WEBVTT

00:08:29.469 --> 00:08:32.535
making them susceptible to infections.

00:08:33.331 --> 00:08:39.316
Chronic illnesses, like diabetes,
asthma, cardiovascular disease,

00:08:39.340 --> 00:08:44.746
will follow those children into adulthood
and likely shorten their lives.

00:08:45.430 --> 00:08:49.665
Mental health problems are linked
to the breakdown of the body.

00:08:49.689 --> 00:08:51.663
I have seen children in detention

00:08:52.559 --> 00:08:55.961
who have recurrent
and disturbing nightmares,

00:08:55.985 --> 00:08:58.086
night terrors,

00:08:58.110 --> 00:09:00.952
depression and anxiety,